msgid ""
"<qt>At least one <b>template file</b> used to export your address book to HTM"
"L is missing. Continue anyway?<br><br><i>(Templates are used as a basis to cr"
"eate the HTML files themselves. The HTML export will most probably not work w"
"ithout it.)</i></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Mangler minst en <b>malfil</b> for eksport av adresseboken til HTML. "
"Fortsett likevel? <br><br><i>(Malene blir brukt som grunnlag for å lage selve "
"HTML-filene. HTML-eksporteringen vil sannsynligvis ikke virke uten.)</i></qt>"

